": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/07-poc-roadmap-and-acceptance.md", "source_location": "\u00a7Phase 7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "bin/demo and the Watchers example must run on a clean database, print every golden value with PASS/FAIL, and exit non-zero on any mismatch."}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_07_poc_roadmap_and_acceptance_phase_8_extensions", "label": "Phase 8 (P1) - Extensions", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/07-poc-roadmap-and-acceptance.md", "source_location": "\u00a7Phase 8", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_07_poc_roadmap_and_acceptance_scenario_a_quote_verification", "label": "Scenario A - Quote verification", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/07-poc-roadmap-and-acceptance.md", "source_location": "\u00a7Acceptance Scenarios", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "TEXTUAL claim, agent verification CONFIRMED, claim SUPPORTED and provisional, reviewer audit clears provisional and raises verifier reputation."}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_07_poc_roadmap_and_acceptance_scenario_b_poisoned_contribution", "label": "Scenario B - Poisoned contribution", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/07-poc-roadmap-and-acceptance.md", "source_location": "\u00a7Acceptance Scenarios", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Exists to demonstrate that validation is not correctness and that the provisional flag matters: a real excerpt passes automated checks, a sampled audit returns SUBSTANTIVE_ERROR, the link is invalidated, and the old snapshot still shows the poisoned state with its trace."}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_07_poc_roadmap_and_acceptance_scenario_c_dependent_evidence", "label": "Scenario C - Dependent evidence", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/07-poc-roadmap-and-acceptance.md", "source_location": "\u00a7Acceptance Scenarios", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Three articles and a press release repeat one survey: four lineages SUPPORTED 0.9085 becomes one lineage LEANS_SUPPORTED 0.7146 after the independence check."}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_07_poc_roadmap_and_acceptance_scenario_d_omitted_qualifier", "label": "Scenario D - Omitted qualifier", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/07-poc-roadmap-and-acceptance.md", "source_location": "\u00a7Acceptance Scenarios", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The qualifier check finds the survey sampled only customers; C2 becomes UNRESOLVED while the narrower C3 stays SUPPORTED."}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_07_poc_roadmap_and_acceptance_scenario_e_fabricated_citation", "label": "Scenario E - Fabricated citation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/07-poc-roadmap-and-acceptance.md", "source_location": "\u00a7Acceptance Scenarios", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "C4 leans contradicted and the per-source card flags the citation as unverified."}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_07_poc_roadmap_and_acceptance_scenario_f_coverage_vs_probability", "label": "Scenario F - Coverage vs. probability", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/07-poc-roadmap-and-acceptance.md", "source_location": "\u00a7Acceptance Scenarios", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A claim is SUPPORTED with 1 of 4 review checks; the UI renders display rule 5."}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_07_poc_roadmap_and_acceptance_scenario_g_non_scoreable_claim", "label": "Scenario G - Non-scoreable claim", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/07-poc-roadmap-and-acceptance.md", "source_location": "\u00a7Acceptance Scenarios", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A NORMATIVE claim gets NOT_APPLICABLE and no number, but its premises can still be linked and displayed."}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_07_poc_roadmap_and_acceptance_scenario_h_alternative_model", "label": "Scenario H - Alternative model", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/07-poc-roadmap-and-acceptance.md", "source_location": "\u00a7Acceptance Scenarios", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "C6 is UNRESOLVED under ledger-default and NOT_APPLICABLE (NOT_SCORED_BY_MODEL) under ledger-strict; /compare names scored_types as responsible."}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_07_poc_roadmap_and_acceptance_scenario_i_visible_moderation", "label": "Scenario I - Visible moderation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/07-poc-roadmap-and-acceptance.md", "source_location": "\u00a7Acceptance Scenarios", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A PRIVATE_INDIVIDUAL quarantine hides the text but leaves a stub with moderator key, date and reason; an old snapshot still records that the claim existed."}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_07_poc_roadmap_and_acceptance_scenario_j_replay", "label": "Scenario J - Replay", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/07-poc-roadmap-and-acceptance.md", "source_location": "\u00a7Acceptance Scenarios", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Drop projections and caches, replay, and claim_score_digest for every pinned snapshot is unchanged."}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_07_poc_roadmap_and_acceptance_first_experiments", "label": "First Experiments (after P0 passes)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/07-poc-roadmap-and-acceptance.md", "source_location": "\u00a7First Experiments", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "P0 proves the mechanics; these test the product hypothesis: claim identity, single-user value, audit multiplier (useful accepted contributions divided by audits and corrections required - below 1 costs more than it helps), answers without graphs, and independence impact."}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_07_poc_roadmap_and_acceptance_required_test_areas", "label": "Required Test Areas", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/07-poc-roadmap-and-acceptance.md", "source_location": "\u00a7Required Test Areas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Security and scoring tests matter more than UI tests."}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_07_poc_roadmap_and_acceptance_scale_expectations", "label": "Scale Expectations", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/07-poc-roadmap-and-acceptance.md"